            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Firstlight 0.2.8

- Fix leaderboard rows jumping when switching tabs, periods or metrics.
- Restore profile details and live activity on the leaderboard where sharing permissions allow them.
- Keep loading and retry feedback within the Invite and Bump button transition.
- Match the onboarding stats transition to the profile experience.
- Remove unwanted blue focus rings from the menu-bar panel.
]]></description>
