            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Firstlight 0.2.7

- Connect your personal Spotify app to show what you are listening to and share music with friends.
- Open Firstlight and your agents with customizable keyboard shortcuts.
- Choose how much app and agent activity you share with friends and on your public page.
- Improve live presence, menu-bar friend ordering and profile navigation.
- Fix Bump lighting and smooth countdowns, period switching, notifications, onboarding and Settings feedback.
- Speed up public profile pages and improve their maps.
]]></description>
